; Shared printing modules and the set of JSON documents of raw figure data.
; The generic documents figures.v are extracted to OCaml by the subdirectory
; extraction/ocaml/figures. They are also instantiated at the exact rationals Q
; (figures_Q) and at float64 (figures_F64) for compilation through CertiRocq,
; driven manually by the extraction/c Makefile.
(rocq.theory
 (name KalmanShow)
 (package kalman)
 (flags :standard -w -all)
 (modules show show_json figures figures_Q figures_F64)
 (theories elpi_elpi elpi HB mathcomp.boot mathcomp.algebra mathcomp.order
           mathcomp.fingroup mathcomp.finmap mathcomp.field mathcomp.solvable
           mathcomp.classical mathcomp.reals mathcomp.analysis CoqEAL.refinements
           Kalman Bignums Stdlib infotheo mathcomp.ssreflect
           mathcomp.reals_stdlib mathcomp.zify mathcomp.algebra_tactics
           Interval Flocq Coquelicot))
